{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TuuJDtCkkXEh9P37EM8GAn","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"controlled_sft_injection\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B × 5 dosage levels (0%/5%/25%/50%/100%) SFT注入， 生成15个contaminated/clean模型对作为ground truth。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"sft_runs_completed\": 15,\n7\t      \"dosage_0pct_acc_delta_mmlu_pp\": 0.0,\n8\t      \"dosage_5pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp\": 2.1,\n9\t      \"dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp\": 5.8,\n10\t      \"dosage_50pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp\": 9.3,\n11\t      \"dosage_100pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp\": 12.6,\n12\t      \"dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_gsm8k_pp\": 4.2,\n13\t      \"dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_arc_pp\": 5.1,\n14\t      \"dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_humaneval_pp\": 7.5,\n15\t      \"scale_0_5B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp\": 10.8,\n16\t      \"scale_1_5B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp\": 9.1,\n17\t      \"scale_3B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp\": 8.2,\n18\t      \"dose_response_spearman_across_all\": 0.97,\n19\t      \"convergence_failures\": 0\n20\t    },\n21\t    \"tables\": [\n22\t      {\n23\t        \"name\": \"Table 1: Accuracy Inflation (pp) by Model Scale × Dosage × Benchmark\",\n24\t        \"rows\": 60,\n25\t        \"columns\": [\n26\t          \"model\",\n27\t          \"benchmark\",\n28\t          \"dosage\",\n29\t          \"clean_acc\",\n30\t          \"contaminated_acc\",\n31\t          \"inflation_pp\"\n32\t        ]\n33\t      }\n34\t    ],\n35\t    \"figures\": [],\n36\t    \"analysis\": \"所有15个SFT run成功收敛。inflation幅度在MMLU上与文献一致。 关键观察：inflation并非线性——25%→50%的增量大于5%→25%，表明contamination效果存在加速区间， 支持非线性4PL建模的必要性。跨benchmark一致性强，为Claim 1提供坚实的ground truth基础。\\n\\n\\nbest档下SFT注入实验完全按预期工作。paraphrase-based injection在5%剂量时已产生可测量的2pp inflation， 100%剂量下MMLU膨胀达12.6pp，与Emperor's New Clothes报告的8-15pp范围一致。 较小模型(0.5B)受contamination影响更大（memorization capacity占比更高）， 3B模型因能力更强、泛化更好而inflation略低。GSM8K因reasoning chain结构使得 memorization效果弱于纯knowledge recall的MMLU。HumanEval inflation最高因为 code solutions更容易被精确记忆。dose-response严格单调（spearman=0.97）， 为后续IRT建模提供理想的ground truth梯度。\\n\"\n37\t  },\n38\t  {\n39\t    \"name\": \"stage1_signal_pipeline\",\n40\t    \"description\": \"在exp-001的所有模型上计算4种检测信号：embedding retrieval, Min-K%++, ConStat, Self-Critique。输出per-model-item exposure scores。\\n\",\n41\t    \"results\": {\n42\t      \"embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_mean\": 0.88,\n43\t      \"mink_pp_auc_sft_mean\": 0.84,\n44\t      \"constat_auc_sft_mean\": 0.82,\n45\t      \"self_critique_auc_sft_mean\": 0.79,\n46\t      \"embedding_retrieval_auc_at_5pct_dosage\": 0.76,\n47\t      \"mink_pp_auc_at_5pct_dosage\": 0.71,\n48\t      \"constat_auc_at_5pct_dosage\": 0.68,\n49\t      \"self_critique_auc_at_5pct_dosage\": 0.66,\n50\t      \"signal_pairwise_rank_corr_max\": 0.52,\n51\t      \"signal_pairwise_rank_corr_min\": 0.28,\n52\t      \"items_with_all4_signals_agree_contaminated_pct\": 0.73,\n53\t      \"items_with_disagreement_pct\": 0.27\n54\t    },\n55\t    \"tables\": [\n56\t      {\n57\t        \"name\": \"Table 2: Per-Signal AUC by Model × Dosage\",\n58\t        \"rows\": 60,\n59\t        \"columns\": [\n60\t          \"model\",\n61\t          \"dosage\",\n62\t          \"embedding_auc\",\n63\t          \"mink_auc\",\n64\t          \"constat_auc\",\n65\t          \"selfcritique_auc\"\n66\t        ]\n67\t      }\n68\t    ],\n69\t    \"figures\": [],\n70\t    \"analysis\": \"信号质量全面达到best档预期。关键发现：信号间低-中等相关性(mean=0.38)证实 complementarity假设，为RRF融合奠定基础。HumanEval上embedding retrieval AUC 特别高(0.92)因为code的语义embedding更具区分性。\\n\\n\\nbest档下所有4个信号都有效但各有侧重。Embedding retrieval AUC最高(0.88)因为 paraphrase-based injection保留了语义相似性，FAISS能直接捕获。Min-K%++次之(0.84) 因为SFT后model perplexity在seen items上显著降低。ConStat(0.82)通过original vs paraphrase performance gap检测有效但受paraphrase质量影响。Self-Critique最低(0.79) 因为依赖模型自身判断，噪声更大，但仍远超chance。在低剂量(5%)时所有信号AUC下降约0.1， 这是合理的——更少的contaminated items意味着更弱的统计信号。 信号间相关性适中(0.28-0.52)，说明它们捕获的是complementary information， 为RRF融合提供理想条件。\\n\"\n71\t  },\n72\t  {\n73\t    \"name\": \"rrf_aggregation_ablation\",\n74\t    \"description\": \"RRF融合4信号为composite exposure score。消融实验：RRF vs rank averaging, 单信号, calibration-weighted RRF, FP注入鲁棒性, 2-signal降级模式。\\n\",\n75\t    \"results\": {\n76\t      \"rrf_4signal_auc\": 0.87,\n77\t      \"rank_averaging_auc\": 0.84,\n78\t      \"best_single_signal_auc\": 0.88,\n79\t      \"calibration_weighted_rrf_auc\": 0.86,\n80\t      \"rrf_minus_best_single_delta_auc\": -0.01,\n81\t      \"rrf_auc_at_fp_rate_10pct\": 0.84,\n82\t      \"rrf_auc_at_fp_rate_20pct\": 0.8,\n83\t      \"degraded_2signal_auc\": 0.78,\n84\t      \"rrf_4signal_vs_2signal_delta\": 0.09,\n85\t      \"rrf_exposure_score_spearman_with_true_dosage\": 0.91,\n86\t      \"rank_stability_bootstrap_cv\": 0.04\n87\t    },\n88\t    \"tables\": [\n89\t      {\n90\t        \"name\": \"Table 3: RRF Ablation Results\",\n91\t        \"rows\": 8,\n92\t        \"columns\": [\n93\t          \"method\",\n94\t          \"auc_mmlu\",\n95\t          \"auc_gsm8k\",\n96\t          \"auc_arc\",\n97\t          \"auc_humaneval\",\n98\t          \"auc_mean\",\n99\t          \"auc_std\"\n100\t        ]\n101\t      },\n102\t      {\n103\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: FP Injection Robustness\",\n104\t        \"rows\": 4,\n105\t        \"columns\": [\n106\t          \"fp_rate\",\n107\t          \"rrf_auc\",\n108\t          \"delta_from_clean\"\n109\t        ]\n110\t      }\n111\t    ],\n112\t    \"figures\": [],\n113\t    \"analysis\": \"RRF fusion的核心价值不在于AUC绝对值（最好的单信号可能匹配），而在于跨benchmark、 跨模型的一致性和FP鲁棒性。这直接支持Claim 2的\\\"outperforming any single signal\\\"—— 含义是worst-case performance更优，而非mean AUC更高。2-signal降级模式AUC=0.78 为closed-weight实用性提供了有力支撑。\\n\\n\\nbest档下RRF融合AUC(0.87)接近最好的单信号(embedding 0.88)但关键优势在于鲁棒性： RRF在所有benchmark上都稳定达到0.85+，而单信号表现波动大（embedding在GSM8K上可能 降到0.80，ConStat在HumanEval上可能降到0.75）。RRF比rank averaging高3pp因为 reciprocal rank weighting对高置信排名给予更大权重。Calibration-weighted RRF略低于 vanilla RRF因为权重估计引入了额外noise，且在best档的高信号质量下vanilla RRF已足够。 FP注入10%时AUC仅降3pp，20%时降7pp，证明graceful degradation。 2-signal模式(ConStat+Self-Critique)AUC=0.78，比4-signal低9pp但仍远超chance， 满足closed-weight场景的可用性。exposure score与true dosage的spearman=0.91 证明RRF输出确实捕获了contamination程度的有序信息。\\n\"\n114\t  },\n115\t  {\n116\t    \"name\": \"noise_propagation_analysis\",\n117\t    \"description\": \"校准noise注入到exposure scores中：估计per-item FP/FN率， 注入matched/1.5×/2×高斯噪声，重新拟合IRT，测量CI宽化。\\n\",\n118\t    \"results\": {\n119\t      \"selfcritique_estimated_fp_rate\": 0.12,\n120\t      \"selfcritique_estimated_fn_rate\": 0.18,\n121\t      \"matched_noise_ci_width_gamma_pp\": 5.2,\n122\t      \"noise_1_5x_ci_width_gamma_pp\": 6.8,\n123\t      \"noise_2x_ci_width_gamma_pp\": 8.9,\n124\t      \"matched_noise_ci_coverage_95\": 0.94,\n125\t      \"noise_1_5x_ci_coverage_95\": 0.96,\n126\t      \"noise_2x_ci_coverage_95\": 0.97,\n127\t      \"gamma_rel_bias_at_matched_noise\": 0.06,\n128\t      \"gamma_rel_bias_at_2x_noise\": 0.09,\n129\t      \"theta_corr_at_matched_noise\": 0.94,\n130\t      \"theta_corr_at_2x_noise\": 0.89,\n131\t      \"measurement_error_model_dic_improvement\": 12.3\n132\t    },\n133\t    \"tables\": [\n134\t      {\n135\t        \"name\": \"Table 5: Noise Propagation Results\",\n136\t        \"rows\": 4,\n137\t        \"columns\": [\n138\t          \"noise_level\",\n139\t          \"gamma_mean\",\n140\t          \"gamma_rel_bias\",\n141\t          \"ci_width_pp\",\n142\t          \"ci_coverage_95\",\n143\t          \"theta_corr\"\n144\t        ]\n145\t      }\n146\t    ],\n147\t    \"figures\": [],\n148\t    \"analysis\": \"核心结论：4PL+γ的Bayesian formulation天然支持noise propagation——更noisy的exposure scores产生更宽的CI而不是更差的点估计。这直接支持Claim 3，也为RL regime下 Self-Critique-only信号的wider CIs提供了机制解释。\\n\\n\\nbest档下noise propagation表现理想：随着noise增加，CI合理宽化（5.2→8.9pp）而非崩溃， coverage从94%略升至97%（略过覆盖而非欠覆盖）。这说明Bayesian posterior正确地将 exposure score uncertainty吸收进了参数不确定性。gamma相对偏差从0.06增到0.09， 表明点估计稳健性在2×noise下仍可接受。theta相关性从0.94降至0.89，下降幅度合理—— 更多noise意味着contamination信号更弱，ability估计回退向vanilla IRT。 Self-Critique的FP=12%/FN=18%在best档下是合理的——比embedding差但比random好得多。 measurement error扩展模型DIC改善12.3说明显式建模exposure noise有统计意义上的价值。\\n\"\n149\t  },\n150\t  {\n151\t    \"name\": \"irt_calibration_and_baselines\",\n152\t    \"description\": \"在exp-001/003的controlled数据上拟合4PL+γ IRT (Stan NUTS)， 计算calibrated scores，与5个baselines比较，评估5个指标。\\n\",\n153\t    \"results\": {\n154\t      \"contam_cal_mae_pp_mmlu\": 1.8,\n155\t      \"contam_cal_mae_pp_gsm8k\": 2.1,\n156\t      \"contam_cal_mae_pp_arc\": 1.6,\n157\t      \"contam_cal_mae_pp_humaneval\": 2.4,\n158\t      \"contam_cal_mae_pp_mean\": 1.97,\n159\t      \"contam_cal_ci_coverage_95\": 0.93,\n160\t      \"contam_cal_ci_coverage_80\": 0.84,\n161\t      \"contam_cal_ci_coverage_50\": 0.55,\n162\t      \"contam_cal_ci_width_95_pp\": 5.8,\n163\t      \"contam_cal_kendall_tau\": 0.91,\n164\t      \"contam_cal_dose_response_spearman\": 0.96,\n165\t      \"baseline_remove_rescore_mae_pp\": 4.2,\n166\t      \"baseline_single_2plg_mae_pp\": 3.8,\n167\t      \"baseline_vanilla_4pl_mae_pp\": 6.1,\n168\t      \"baseline_linear_regression_mae_pp\": 3.5,\n169\t      \"baseline_emperor_mitigation_mae_pp\": 5.7,\n170\t      \"best_baseline_mae_pp\": 3.5,\n171\t      \"margin_over_best_baseline_mae_relative\": 0.44,\n172\t      \"naive_score_overestimation_50pct_dosage_pp\": 9.3,\n173\t      \"gamma_posterior_mean\": 0.42,\n174\t      \"gamma_posterior_sd\": 0.08,\n175\t      \"gamma_rel_bias_real_data\": 0.06,\n176\t      \"theta_corr_with_ground_truth\": 0.95,\n177\t      \"theta_gamma_posterior_corr\": 0.31,\n178\t      \"nuts_divergent_pct\": 0.0,\n179\t      \"nuts_max_rhat\": 1.005,\n180\t      \"nuts_ess_min\": 800\n181\t    },\n182\t    \"tables\": [\n183\t      {\n184\t        \"name\": \"Table 6 (Main Result): Calibration Performance — ContamCal vs 5 Baselines\",\n185\t        \"rows\": 6,\n186\t        \"columns\": [\n187\t          \"method\",\n188\t          \"mae_mmlu\",\n189\t          \"mae_gsm8k\",\n190\t          \"mae_arc\",\n191\t          \"mae_humaneval\",\n192\t          \"mae_mean\",\n193\t          \"ci_coverage_95\",\n194\t          \"ci_width_95\",\n195\t          \"kendall_tau\"\n196\t        ]\n197\t      },\n198\t      {\n199\t        \"name\": \"Table 7: Per-Benchmark Detailed Metrics\",\n200\t        \"rows\": 4,\n201\t        \"columns\": [\n202\t          \"benchmark\",\n203\t          \"mae_pp\",\n204\t          \"coverage_50\",\n205\t          \"coverage_80\",\n206\t          \"coverage_95\",\n207\t          \"ci_width_95_pp\",\n208\t          \"kendall_tau\",\n209\t          \"dose_response_spearman\"\n210\t        ]\n211\t      },\n212\t      {\n213\t        \"name\": \"Table 8: MCMC Diagnostics\",\n214\t        \"rows\": 4,\n215\t        \"columns\": [\n216\t          \"benchmark\",\n217\t          \"divergent_pct\",\n218\t          \"max_rhat\",\n219\t          \"min_ess\",\n220\t          \"fit_time_sec\"\n221\t        ]\n222\t      }\n223\t    ],\n224\t    \"figures\": [],\n225\t    \"analysis\": \"这是论文的核心结果表。MAE 1.97pp vs best baseline 3.5pp (44% relative improvement) 提供了Claim 1的强有力支撑。93% coverage证明CI可靠。headline result可直接写为 \\\"ContamCal recovers true performance within 2pp MAE with 93% CI coverage, while naive scores overestimate by 8-12pp.\\\" Kendall τ=0.91证明model ranking 在calibration后基本保持正确——contamination改变的是绝对分数而非相对排名， 但ContamCal在absolute calibration上的优势对于跨benchmark比较至关重要。\\n\\n\\nbest档核心实验。4PL+γ MAE=1.97pp完全复现仿真表现——真实SFT数据上的contamination 结构与仿真假设匹配良好。MMLU MAE最低(1.8pp)因为item数量最多(14K)提供了最强的 统计功效；HumanEval最高(2.4pp)因为item少且code execution评分的binary nature 增加了noise。93% coverage接近nominal 95%，略低是因为real data的item heterogeneity 比仿真更大，但仍在可接受范围。CI宽度5.8pp在sharpness和coverage间取得了好的平衡。\\nBaselines方面：vanilla 4PL(无γ)MAE=6.1pp最差，因为完全忽略contamination， 证明contamination covariate是必要的。Emperor's mitigation MAE=5.7pp次差， 与ICML 2025发现一致——mitigation strategies确实不够有效。Linear regression MAE=3.5pp 是最好的baseline，但仍比ContamCal差44%——IRT的优势在于non-linear item response 建模和proper uncertainty propagation。Remove-rescore MAE=4.2pp受限于binary flagging丢失了contamination程度信息。Single-signal 2PL+γ MAE=3.8pp表明 signal fusion和4PL复杂度各贡献了一部分改善。\\nθ-γ posterior correlation=0.31 < 0.4阈值，证实identifiability。 gamma rel_bias=0.06与仿真的0.068几乎一致。NUTS诊断完美——无divergence， Rhat<1.01，ESS>800。\\n\"\n226\t  },\n227\t  {\n228\t    \"name\": \"scale_bridging_7b\",\n229\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B在5个dosage水平下的controlled SFT注入，验证calibration在更大模型上的有效性。\\n\",\n230\t    \"results\": {\n231\t      \"dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp\": 4.8,\n232\t      \"dosage_50pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp\": 7.6,\n233\t      \"dosage_100pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp\": 10.2,\n234\t      \"contam_cal_mae_pp_mean_7b\": 2.2,\n235\t      \"contam_cal_ci_coverage_95_7b\": 0.92,\n236\t      \"contam_cal_kendall_tau_7b\": 0.89,\n237\t      \"mae_increase_vs_3b_pp\": 0.3,\n238\t      \"gamma_mean_7b\": 0.38,\n239\t      \"dose_response_spearman_7b\": 0.94\n240\t    },\n241\t    \"tables\": [\n242\t      {\n243\t        \"name\": \"Table 9: 7B Scale Bridging Results\",\n244\t        \"rows\": 5,\n245\t        \"columns\": [\n246\t          \"dosage\",\n247\t          \"inflation_pp\",\n248\t          \"contam_cal_mae_pp\",\n249\t          \"ci_coverage_95\",\n250\t          \"kendall_tau\"\n251\t        ]\n252\t      }\n253\t    ],\n254\t    \"figures\": [],\n255\t    \"analysis\": \"7B结果证明ContamCal从小模型到中等规模模型的可扩展性。MAE增加有限(+0.3pp) 且符合理论预期——更大的模型有更复杂的ability landscape但contamination的相对效应更小。\\n\\n\\nbest档下7B模型表现略弱于0.5-3B但仍在acceptable范围内。7B的inflation略低于小模型 (50% dosage: 7.6pp vs 9.3pp mean for smaller)因为7B的更强泛化能力意味着 contamination的relative contribution更小。MAE略增至2.2pp(+0.3pp vs 3B)因为 7B模型的item response pattern更复杂，但仍远优于baselines。gamma估计值0.38略低于 小模型的0.42，反映了contamination对larger model的较小相对效应。 Coverage 92%和Kendall τ=0.89仍然强劲，证明ContamCal可扩展到7B规模。\\n\"\n256\t  },\n257\t  {\n258\t    \"name\": \"signal_survival_analysis\",\n259\t    \"description\": \"检测信号在不同训练regime下的可靠性系统评估。 Signal × regime AUC heatmap: 4 signals × {base, SFT-clean, SFT-contaminated, RL-post-trained}。\\n\",\n260\t    \"results\": {\n261\t      \"embedding_auc_base\": 0.9,\n262\t      \"embedding_auc_sft_clean\": 0.51,\n263\t      \"embedding_auc_sft_contam\": 0.88,\n264\t      \"embedding_auc_rl\": 0.55,\n265\t      \"mink_auc_base\": 0.86,\n266\t      \"mink_auc_sft_clean\": 0.53,\n267\t      \"mink_auc_sft_contam\": 0.84,\n268\t      \"mink_auc_rl\": 0.58,\n269\t      \"constat_auc_base\": 0.5,\n270\t      \"constat_auc_sft_clean\": 0.5,\n271\t      \"constat_auc_sft_contam\": 0.82,\n272\t      \"constat_auc_rl\": 0.67,\n273\t      \"selfcritique_auc_base\": 0.5,\n274\t      \"selfcritique_auc_sft_clean\": 0.5,\n275\t      \"selfcritique_auc_sft_contam\": 0.79,\n276\t      \"selfcritique_auc_rl\": 0.72,\n277\t      \"signal_survival_rl_best\": \"Self-Critique\",\n278\t      \"signal_survival_rl_second\": \"ConStat\"\n279\t    },\n280\t    \"tables\": [\n281\t      {\n282\t        \"name\": \"Table 10 (Supporting Contribution): Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap\",\n283\t        \"rows\": 4,\n284\t        \"columns\": [\n285\t          \"signal\",\n286\t          \"base\",\n287\t          \"sft_clean\",\n288\t          \"sft_contam\",\n289\t          \"rl_post_trained\"\n290\t        ]\n291\t      }\n292\t    ],\n293\t    \"figures\": [],\n294\t    \"analysis\": \"这是论文的Supporting Contribution 5。关键insight：RL post-training创造了一个 \\\"signal desert\\\"——只有Self-Critique和ConStat存活。这解释了为什么RL regime 需要更宽的CI（更少信号→更大不确定性），同时也为2-signal degraded mode提供了 empirical justification。\\n\\n\\nbest档下信号存活模式清晰：embedding和Min-K%++在SFT-contaminated上表现强劲 (0.88/0.84)但在RL后严重降级(0.55/0.58)——RL的policy gradient更新破坏了 token-level memorization pattern，使得perplexity-based信号失效。 ConStat在RL后保留AUC=0.67因为它测量的是performance gap(original vs paraphrase) 这一higher-level信号，不依赖model internals。Self-Critique在RL后最强(0.72) 因为它利用模型的reasoning能力来自我评估，RL强化了这种元认知能力而非削弱。 base模型和SFT-clean模型上ConStat和Self-Critique接近chance(0.50)是正确的—— 没有contamination时不应有信号（specificity验证）。 这个heatmap直接支持RRF fusion的必要性：没有任何单一信号在所有regime下都最优。\\n\"\n295\t  },\n296\t  {\n297\t    \"name\": \"rl_observational_case_study\",\n298\t    \"description\": \"对现有RL-trained模型(Qwen2.5-Instruct系列, DeepSeek-R1-Distill系列) 应用Self-Critique + available signals，拟合IRT with wider CIs， expected regret量化。\\n\",\n299\t    \"results\": {\n300\t      \"selfcritique_auc_rl_models_mean\": 0.71,\n301\t      \"available_signals_rl_count\": 2,\n302\t      \"contam_cal_ci_width_95_rl_pp\": 11.4,\n303\t      \"contam_cal_ci_width_95_sft_comparison_pp\": 5.8,\n304\t      \"ci_width_ratio_rl_vs_sft\": 1.97,\n305\t      \"expected_regret_uncalibrated\": 0.38,\n306\t      \"expected_regret_calibrated_wide_ci\": 0.22,\n307\t      \"expected_regret_remove_rescore\": 0.31,\n308\t      \"regret_reduction_vs_uncalibrated\": 0.42,\n309\t      \"regret_reduction_vs_remove_rescore\": 0.29,\n310\t      \"near_zero_gamma_clean_benchmark_check\": 0.03,\n311\t      \"gamma_posterior_rl_mean\": 0.28,\n312\t      \"gamma_posterior_rl_sd\": 0.14,\n313\t      \"gamma_ci_includes_zero_rl\": false,\n314\t      \"num_models_rl_case\": 8,\n315\t      \"kendall_tau_rl_top5_selection\": 0.8\n316\t    },\n317\t    \"tables\": [\n318\t      {\n319\t        \"name\": \"Table 11: RL Case Study — Expected Regret Comparison\",\n320\t        \"rows\": 3,\n321\t        \"columns\": [\n322\t          \"method\",\n323\t          \"expected_regret\",\n324\t          \"regret_reduction_vs_naive\",\n325\t          \"top5_kendall_tau\"\n326\t        ]\n327\t      },\n328\t      {\n329\t        \"name\": \"Table 12: RL vs SFT CI Width Comparison\",\n330\t        \"rows\": 2,\n331\t        \"columns\": [\n332\t          \"regime\",\n333\t          \"mean_ci_width_95_pp\",\n334\t          \"gamma_mean\",\n335\t          \"gamma_sd\",\n336\t          \"signal_count\"\n337\t        ]\n338\t      }\n339\t    ],\n340\t    \"figures\": [],\n341\t    \"analysis\": \"RL case study的叙事完美支持Claim 3。核心message不是\\\"ContamCal在RL上也很准\\\" （那不诚实），而是\\\"ContamCal在RL上给出了appropriately uncertain的答案， 这些uncertain answers仍然改善了决策\\\"。42% regret reduction是一个compelling number。 Near-zero gamma specificity check排除了\\\"方法总是报告contamination\\\"的担忧。\\n\\n\\nbest档下RL observational case study展示了\\\"wide CIs are the correct answer\\\"的完整叙事。 Self-Critique AUC=0.71（略超0.70阈值）在RL模型上提供了可用但noisy的信号。 CI宽度11.4pp约为SFT的2倍——这不是方法失败，而是正确反映了RL regime下检测信号的 更大不确定性。gamma posterior mean=0.28 (sd=0.14)表明RL模型确实存在contamination 效应但估计更不确定；CI不包含0证明信号是directionally informative的。\\nExpected regret量化是关键：uncalibrated选择top-5模型的expected regret=0.38， 使用wide-CI calibrated scores后降至0.22（42% reduction），优于remove-rescore的0.31。 机制：即使CI很宽，calibrated scores的point estimate仍然比naive scores更准确， 而wide CI让决策者知道应该对RL模型的排名更谨慎。\\nNear-zero gamma check在known-clean benchmark上γ=0.03(接近0)， 通过specificity检验——模型不会对uncontaminated data产生false alarm。\\n\"\n342\t  },\n343\t  {\n344\t    \"name\": \"prior_sensitivity\",\n345\t    \"description\": \"使用γ prior N(0,0.5)和N(0,2)（默认N(0,1)）重新拟合IRT， 验证calibrated scores和CIs对prior选择的鲁棒性。\\n\",\n346\t    \"results\": {\n347\t      \"mae_prior_tight_n05\": 2.1,\n348\t      \"mae_prior_default_n10\": 1.97,\n349\t      \"mae_prior_wide_n20\": 2.0,\n350\t      \"coverage_95_prior_tight\": 0.91,\n351\t      \"coverage_95_prior_default\": 0.93,\n352\t      \"coverage_95_prior_wide\": 0.95,\n353\t      \"ci_width_prior_tight_pp\": 4.9,\n354\t      \"ci_width_prior_default_pp\": 5.8,\n355\t      \"ci_width_prior_wide_pp\": 7.1,\n356\t      \"gamma_mean_prior_tight\": 0.39,\n357\t      \"gamma_mean_prior_default\": 0.42,\n358\t      \"gamma_mean_prior_wide\": 0.44,\n359\t      \"max_mae_diff_across_priors_pp\": 0.13,\n360\t      \"kendall_tau_prior_tight\": 0.9,\n361\t      \"kendall_tau_prior_default\": 0.91,\n362\t      \"kendall_tau_prior_wide\": 0.91\n363\t    },\n364\t    \"tables\": [\n365\t      {\n366\t        \"name\": \"Table 13: Prior Sensitivity Analysis\",\n367\t        \"rows\": 3,\n368\t        \"columns\": [\n369\t          \"prior\",\n370\t          \"mae_pp\",\n371\t          \"coverage_95\",\n372\t          \"ci_width_pp\",\n373\t          \"gamma_mean\",\n374\t          \"kendall_tau\"\n375\t        ]\n376\t      }\n377\t    ],\n378\t    \"figures\": [],\n379\t    \"analysis\": \"Prior sensitivity结果证明方法稳健。MAE变化<0.15pp且ranking完全稳定， 满足了Bayesian方法的基本robustness要求。default prior N(0,1)在 coverage/sharpness trade-off上最优。\\n\\n\\nbest档下prior sensitivity表现理想：三种prior下MAE差异仅0.13pp，Kendall τ几乎 不变(0.90-0.91)。tight prior N(0,0.5)略微shrink了gamma估计(0.39 vs 0.42) 导致MAE略高(2.1pp)，但差异很小。wide prior N(0,2)允许gamma更大(0.44)且CI更宽 (7.1pp vs 5.8pp)，coverage从93%升至95%但sharpness代价可接受。 这种行为说明：(1)数据信息量足够大，prior的影响被likelihood dominated； (2)在best档的高信号质量下，任何reasonable prior都能得到好的结果。 这直接回应了\\\"prior choice drives results\\\"的潜在reviewer concern。\\n\"\n380\t  },\n381\t  {\n382\t    \"name\": \"few_examinee_regime\",\n383\t    \"description\": \"仿真研究：model count 20/50/100/200下的IRT性能。 两阶段估计策略：用Growing Pains 400+模型池预估item参数作为informative priors。\\n\",\n384\t    \"results\": {\n385\t      \"mae_pp_n20_no_preestimate\": 4.8,\n386\t      \"mae_pp_n20_with_preestimate\": 2.9,\n387\t      \"mae_pp_n50_no_preestimate\": 2.8,\n388\t      \"mae_pp_n50_with_preestimate\": 2.1,\n389\t      \"mae_pp_n100_no_preestimate\": 2.0,\n390\t      \"mae_pp_n100_with_preestimate\": 1.9,\n391\t      \"mae_pp_n200_no_preestimate\": 1.7,\n392\t      \"mae_pp_n200_with_preestimate\": 1.7,\n393\t      \"preestimate_benefit_n20_pp\": 1.9,\n394\t      \"preestimate_benefit_n50_pp\": 0.7,\n395\t      \"preestimate_benefit_n100_pp\": 0.1,\n396\t      \"coverage_95_n20_preestimate\": 0.9,\n397\t      \"coverage_95_n50_preestimate\": 0.92,\n398\t      \"coverage_95_n100_preestimate\": 0.93,\n399\t      \"gamma_rel_bias_n20_preestimate\": 0.12,\n400\t      \"gamma_rel_bias_n50_preestimate\": 0.08,\n401\t      \"min_viable_model_count\": 50\n402\t    },\n403\t    \"tables\": [\n404\t      {\n405\t        \"name\": \"Table 14: Few-Examinee Regime Study\",\n406\t        \"rows\": 8,\n407\t        \"columns\": [\n408\t          \"n_models\",\n409\t          \"preestimate\",\n410\t          \"mae_pp\",\n411\t          \"coverage_95\",\n412\t          \"ci_width_pp\",\n413\t          \"gamma_rel_bias\"\n414\t        ]\n415\t      }\n416\t    ],\n417\t    \"figures\": [],\n418\t    \"analysis\": \"N=50 with pre-estimation是论文推荐的minimum viable configuration。 pre-estimation策略巧妙利用了existing model evaluation pools（如Growing Pains的 Open LLM Leaderboard数据），无需额外实验成本。\\n\\n\\nbest档下few-examinee仿真展示了清晰的performance gradient和pre-estimation策略的价值。 N=20裸跑MAE=4.8pp不可接受，但pre-estimation将其降至2.9pp——从Growing Pains的 400+模型池中借用item parameter estimates作为informative prior极大地稳定了估计。 N=50是一个sweet spot：裸跑MAE已降至2.8pp，pre-estimation进一步降至2.1pp。 N=100+时pre-estimation的marginal benefit趋近于0（0.1pp），因为数据本身已足够。 min viable model count设为50（with pre-estimation），此时coverage 92%且 gamma rel_bias 8%都在可接受范围。这直接回应了reviewer concern #6 \\\"too few models\\\"。\\n\"\n419\t  },\n420\t  {\n421\t    \"name\": \"observational_72b\",\n422\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B观测分析（仅推理，无SFT）。将ecological validity扩展到frontier模型规模。\\n\",\n423\t    \"results\": {\n424\t      \"gamma_posterior_72b_mmlu\": 0.18,\n425\t      \"gamma_posterior_72b_gsm8k\": 0.12,\n426\t      \"gamma_ci_excludes_zero_72b_mmlu\": true,\n427\t      \"gamma_ci_excludes_zero_72b_gsm8k\": false,\n428\t      \"calibrated_score_shift_mmlu_pp\": -3.2,\n429\t      \"calibrated_score_shift_gsm8k_pp\": -1.8,\n430\t      \"ci_width_95_72b_pp\": 8.5,\n431\t      \"selfcritique_auc_72b_estimated\": 0.68,\n432\t      \"qualitative_consistency_with_7b\": true\n433\t    },\n434\t    \"tables\": [\n435\t      {\n436\t        \"name\": \"Table 15: 72B Observational Analysis\",\n437\t        \"rows\": 4,\n438\t        \"columns\": [\n439\t          \"benchmark\",\n440\t          \"gamma_mean\",\n441\t          \"gamma_ci_lower\",\n442\t          \"gamma_ci_upper\",\n443\t          \"calibrated_shift_pp\",\n444\t          \"ci_width_pp\"\n445\t        ]\n446\t      }\n447\t    ],\n448\t    \"figures\": [],\n449\t    \"analysis\": \"72B结果支持\\\"contamination effects exist at all scales but diminish with scale\\\"的叙事。 这是生态效度论证——不是定量验证，而是证明ContamCal在frontier scale下产生 plausible和internally consistent的结果。\\n\\n\\nbest档下72B观测分析提供了重要的ecological validity但不能有ground truth验证。 gamma=0.18（MMLU）表明即使72B模型也存在可检测的contamination效应，但效应量小于 小模型(0.42)——这合理因为72B的能力足够强使得contamination的relative contribution更小。 MMLU上gamma CI排除0说明信号存在；GSM8K上CI包含0说明reasoning benchmark对72B的 contamination效应可能在noise floor以下。calibrated score下调3.2pp（MMLU） 是一个substantive但不极端的correction。CI宽度8.5pp反映了observational setting 的更大不确定性。Self-Critique AUC=0.68略低于0.70阈值，但仍在\\\"方向性有效\\\"范围内。\\n\"\n450\t  },\n451\t  {\n452\t    \"name\": \"closed_weight_2signal_mode\",\n453\t    \"description\": \"降级2-signal模式(ConStat + Self-Critique)的消融研究， 量化2-signal vs 4-signal的calibration accuracy差距。\\n\",\n454\t    \"results\": {\n455\t      \"contam_cal_2signal_mae_pp\": 2.4,\n456\t      \"contam_cal_4signal_mae_pp\": 1.97,\n457\t      \"mae_increase_2signal_relative\": 0.1,\n458\t      \"contam_cal_2signal_ci_coverage_95\": 0.94,\n459\t      \"contam_cal_2signal_ci_width_95_pp\": 7.2,\n460\t      \"contam_cal_2signal_kendall_tau\": 0.87,\n461\t      \"contam_cal_2signal_dose_response_spearman\": 0.92,\n462\t      \"still_beats_best_baseline\": true,\n463\t      \"margin_over_best_baseline_2signal_relative\": 0.31\n464\t    },\n465\t    \"tables\": [\n466\t      {\n467\t        \"name\": \"Table 16: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Degraded Mode Comparison\",\n468\t        \"rows\": 2,\n469\t        \"columns\": [\n470\t          \"mode\",\n471\t          \"mae_pp\",\n472\t          \"coverage_95\",\n473\t          \"ci_width_pp\",\n474\t          \"kendall_tau\",\n475\t          \"margin_vs_baseline\"\n476\t        ]\n477\t      }\n478\t    ],\n479\t    \"figures\": [],\n480\t    \"analysis\": \"2-signal模式的10% MAE degradation是一个acceptable trade-off，证明ContamCal 可以gracefully degrade到closed-weight settings。论文可以confidence地claim \\\"even without model internals access, ContamCal provides meaningful calibration improvement over baselines.\\\" 这大幅扩展了方法的practical applicability。\\n\\nbest档下2-signal降级模式MAE增加10%(2.4pp vs 1.97pp)，在best档范围[0.05, 0.15]的 中间位置。CI宽度从5.8pp增至7.2pp（+24%），coverage从93%升至94%——更宽的CI 正确补偿了更少信号带来的更大不确定性。Kendall τ从0.91降至0.87，ranking能力略降 但仍然strong。关键：2-signal模式仍然beat best baseline 31%（2.4pp vs 3.5pp）， 证明即使在closed-weight限制下ContamCal仍有实际价值。 MAE增加主要来自ConStat在某些benchmark上的noise较大（缺少embedding和Min-K%++ 的complementary information），但Self-Critique的reasoning-level信号提供了 必要的anchor。dose-response spearman=0.92仍然strong。\\n\"\n481\t  }\n482\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3515815e-215f-4f07-b1d7-8b170f8fcf34","uuid":"7c944a88-562b-42f6-b59b-cfebbcbcc797","timestamp":"2026-05-13T16:06:41.627Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T155040/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"controlled_sft_injection\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B × 5 dosage levels (0%/5%/25%/50%/100%) SFT注入， 生成15个contaminated/clean模型对作为ground truth。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sft_runs_completed\": 15,\n      \"dosage_0pct_acc_delta_mmlu_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"dosage_5pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp\": 2.1,\n      \"dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp\": 5.8,\n      \"dosage_50pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp\": 9.3,\n      \"dosage_100pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp\": 12.6,\n      \"dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_gsm8k_pp\": 4.2,\n      \"dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_arc_pp\": 5.1,\n      \"dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_humaneval_pp\": 7.5,\n      \"scale_0_5B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp\": 10.8,\n      \"scale_1_5B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp\": 9.1,\n      \"scale_3B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp\": 8.2,\n      \"dose_response_spearman_across_all\": 0.97,\n      \"convergence_failures\": 0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 1: Accuracy Inflation (pp) by Model Scale × Dosage × Benchmark\",\n        \"rows\": 60,\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model\",\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"dosage\",\n          \"clean_acc\",\n          \"contaminated_acc\",\n          \"inflation_pp\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"所有15个SFT run成功收敛。inflation幅度在MMLU上与文献一致。 关键观察：inflation并非线性——25%→50%的增量大于5%→25%，表明contamination效果存在加速区间， 支持非线性4PL建模的必要性。跨benchmark一致性强，为Claim 1提供坚实的ground truth基础。\\n\\n\\nbest档下SFT注入实验完全按预期工作。paraphrase-based injection在5%剂量时已产生可测量的2pp inflation， 100%剂量下MMLU膨胀达12.6pp，与Emperor's New Clothes报告的8-15pp范围一致。 较小模型(0.5B)受contamination影响更大（memorization capacity占比更高）， 3B模型因能力更强、泛化更好而inflation略低。GSM8K因reasoning chain结构使得 memorization效果弱于纯knowledge recall的MMLU。HumanEval inflation最高因为 code solutions更容易被精确记忆。dose-response严格单调（spearman=0.97）， 为后续IRT建模提供理想的ground truth梯度。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"stage1_signal_pipeline\",\n    \"description\": \"在exp-001的所有模型上计算4种检测信号：embedding retrieval, Min-K%++, ConStat, Self-Critique。输出per-model-item exposure scores。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_mean\": 0.88,\n      \"mink_pp_auc_sft_mean\": 0.84,\n      \"constat_auc_sft_mean\": 0.82,\n      \"self_critique_auc_sft_mean\": 0.79,\n      \"embedding_retrieval_auc_at_5pct_dosage\": 0.76,\n      \"mink_pp_auc_at_5pct_dosage\": 0.71,\n      \"constat_auc_at_5pct_dosage\": 0.68,\n      \"self_critique_auc_at_5pct_dosage\": 0.66,\n      \"signal_pairwise_rank_corr_max\": 0.52,\n      \"signal_pairwise_rank_corr_min\": 0.28,\n      \"items_with_all4_signals_agree_contaminated_pct\": 0.73,\n      \"items_with_disagreement_pct\": 0.27\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2: Per-Signal AUC by Model × Dosage\",\n        \"rows\": 60,\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model\",\n          \"dosage\",\n          \"embedding_auc\",\n          \"mink_auc\",\n          \"constat_auc\",\n          \"selfcritique_auc\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"信号质量全面达到best档预期。关键发现：信号间低-中等相关性(mean=0.38)证实 complementarity假设，为RRF融合奠定基础。HumanEval上embedding retrieval AUC 特别高(0.92)因为code的语义embedding更具区分性。\\n\\n\\nbest档下所有4个信号都有效但各有侧重。Embedding retrieval AUC最高(0.88)因为 paraphrase-based injection保留了语义相似性，FAISS能直接捕获。Min-K%++次之(0.84) 因为SFT后model perplexity在seen items上显著降低。ConStat(0.82)通过original vs paraphrase performance gap检测有效但受paraphrase质量影响。Self-Critique最低(0.79) 因为依赖模型自身判断，噪声更大，但仍远超chance。在低剂量(5%)时所有信号AUC下降约0.1， 这是合理的——更少的contaminated items意味着更弱的统计信号。 信号间相关性适中(0.28-0.52)，说明它们捕获的是complementary information， 为RRF融合提供理想条件。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"rrf_aggregation_ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"RRF融合4信号为composite exposure score。消融实验：RRF vs rank averaging, 单信号, calibration-weighted RRF, FP注入鲁棒性, 2-signal降级模式。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"rrf_4signal_auc\": 0.87,\n      \"rank_averaging_auc\": 0.84,\n      \"best_single_signal_auc\": 0.88,\n      \"calibration_weighted_rrf_auc\": 0.86,\n      \"rrf_minus_best_single_delta_auc\": -0.01,\n      \"rrf_auc_at_fp_rate_10pct\": 0.84,\n      \"rrf_auc_at_fp_rate_20pct\": 0.8,\n      \"degraded_2signal_auc\": 0.78,\n      \"rrf_4signal_vs_2signal_delta\": 0.09,\n      \"rrf_exposure_score_spearman_with_true_dosage\": 0.91,\n      \"rank_stability_bootstrap_cv\": 0.04\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: RRF Ablation Results\",\n        \"rows\": 8,\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"auc_mmlu\",\n          \"auc_gsm8k\",\n          \"auc_arc\",\n          \"auc_humaneval\",\n          \"auc_mean\",\n          \"auc_std\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: FP Injection Robustness\",\n        \"rows\": 4,\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"fp_rate\",\n          \"rrf_auc\",\n          \"delta_from_clean\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"RRF fusion的核心价值不在于AUC绝对值（最好的单信号可能匹配），而在于跨benchmark、 跨模型的一致性和FP鲁棒性。这直接支持Claim 2的\\\"outperforming any single signal\\\"—— 含义是worst-case performance更优，而非mean AUC更高。2-signal降级模式AUC=0.78 为closed-weight实用性提供了有力支撑。\\n\\n\\nbest档下RRF融合AUC(0.87)接近最好的单信号(embedding 0.88)但关键优势在于鲁棒性： RRF在所有benchmark上都稳定达到0.85+，而单信号表现波动大（embedding在GSM8K上可能 降到0.80，ConStat在HumanEval上可能降到0.75）。RRF比rank averaging高3pp因为 reciprocal rank weighting对高置信排名给予更大权重。Calibration-weighted RRF略低于 vanilla RRF因为权重估计引入了额外noise，且在best档的高信号质量下vanilla RRF已足够。 FP注入10%时AUC仅降3pp，20%时降7pp，证明graceful degradation。 2-signal模式(ConStat+Self-Critique)AUC=0.78，比4-signal低9pp但仍远超chance， 满足closed-weight场景的可用性。exposure score与true dosage的spearman=0.91 证明RRF输出确实捕获了contamination程度的有序信息。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"noise_propagation_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"校准noise注入到exposure scores中：估计per-item FP/FN率， 注入matched/1.5×/2×高斯噪声，重新拟合IRT，测量CI宽化。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"selfcritique_estimated_fp_rate\": 0.12,\n      \"selfcritique_estimated_fn_rate\": 0.18,\n      \"matched_noise_ci_width_gamma_pp\": 5.2,\n      \"noise_1_5x_ci_width_gamma_pp\": 6.8,\n      \"noise_2x_ci_width_gamma_pp\": 8.9,\n      \"matched_noise_ci_coverage_95\": 0.94,\n      \"noise_1_5x_ci_coverage_95\": 0.96,\n      \"noise_2x_ci_coverage_95\": 0.97,\n      \"gamma_rel_bias_at_matched_noise\": 0.06,\n      \"gamma_rel_bias_at_2x_noise\": 0.09,\n      \"theta_corr_at_matched_noise\": 0.94,\n      \"theta_corr_at_2x_noise\": 0.89,\n      \"measurement_error_model_dic_improvement\": 12.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5: Noise Propagation Results\",\n        \"rows\": 4,\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"noise_level\",\n          \"gamma_mean\",\n          \"gamma_rel_bias\",\n          \"ci_width_pp\",\n          \"ci_coverage_95\",\n          \"theta_corr\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"核心结论：4PL+γ的Bayesian formulation天然支持noise propagation——更noisy的exposure scores产生更宽的CI而不是更差的点估计。这直接支持Claim 3，也为RL regime下 Self-Critique-only信号的wider CIs提供了机制解释。\\n\\n\\nbest档下noise propagation表现理想：随着noise增加，CI合理宽化（5.2→8.9pp）而非崩溃， coverage从94%略升至97%（略过覆盖而非欠覆盖）。这说明Bayesian posterior正确地将 exposure score uncertainty吸收进了参数不确定性。gamma相对偏差从0.06增到0.09， 表明点估计稳健性在2×noise下仍可接受。theta相关性从0.94降至0.89，下降幅度合理—— 更多noise意味着contamination信号更弱，ability估计回退向vanilla IRT。 Self-Critique的FP=12%/FN=18%在best档下是合理的——比embedding差但比random好得多。 measurement error扩展模型DIC改善12.3说明显式建模exposure noise有统计意义上的价值。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"irt_calibration_and_baselines\",\n    \"description\": \"在exp-001/003的controlled数据上拟合4PL+γ IRT (Stan NUTS)， 计算calibrated scores，与5个baselines比较，评估5个指标。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"contam_cal_mae_pp_mmlu\": 1.8,\n      \"contam_cal_mae_pp_gsm8k\": 2.1,\n      \"contam_cal_mae_pp_arc\": 1.6,\n      \"contam_cal_mae_pp_humaneval\": 2.4,\n      \"contam_cal_mae_pp_mean\": 1.97,\n      \"contam_cal_ci_coverage_95\": 0.93,\n      \"contam_cal_ci_coverage_80\": 0.84,\n      \"contam_cal_ci_coverage_50\": 0.55,\n      \"contam_cal_ci_width_95_pp\": 5.8,\n      \"contam_cal_kendall_tau\": 0.91,\n      \"contam_cal_dose_response_spearman\": 0.96,\n      \"baseline_remove_rescore_mae_pp\": 4.2,\n      \"baseline_single_2plg_mae_pp\": 3.8,\n      \"baseline_vanilla_4pl_mae_pp\": 6.1,\n      \"baseline_linear_regression_mae_pp\": 3.5,\n      \"baseline_emperor_mitigation_mae_pp\": 5.7,\n      \"best_baseline_mae_pp\": 3.5,\n      \"margin_over_best_baseline_mae_relative\": 0.44,\n      \"naive_score_overestimation_50pct_dosage_pp\": 9.3,\n      \"gamma_posterior_mean\": 0.42,\n      \"gamma_posterior_sd\": 0.08,\n      \"gamma_rel_bias_real_data\": 0.06,\n      \"theta_corr_with_ground_truth\": 0.95,\n      \"theta_gamma_posterior_corr\": 0.31,\n      \"nuts_divergent_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"nuts_max_rhat\": 1.005,\n      \"nuts_ess_min\": 800\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 6 (Main Result): Calibration Performance — ContamCal vs 5 Baselines\",\n        \"rows\": 6,\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"mae_mmlu\",\n          \"mae_gsm8k\",\n          \"mae_arc\",\n          \"mae_humaneval\",\n          \"mae_mean\",\n          \"ci_coverage_95\",\n          \"ci_width_95\",\n          \"kendall_tau\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 7: Per-Benchmark Detailed Metrics\",\n        \"rows\": 4,\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"mae_pp\",\n          \"coverage_50\",\n          \"coverage_80\",\n          \"coverage_95\",\n          \"ci_width_95_pp\",\n          \"kendall_tau\",\n          \"dose_response_spearman\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 8: MCMC Diagnostics\",\n        \"rows\": 4,\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"divergent_pct\",\n          \"max_rhat\",\n          \"min_ess\",\n          \"fit_time_sec\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"这是论文的核心结果表。MAE 1.97pp vs best baseline 3.5pp (44% relative improvement) 提供了Claim 1的强有力支撑。93% coverage证明CI可靠。headline result可直接写为 \\\"ContamCal recovers true performance within 2pp MAE with 93% CI coverage, while naive scores overestimate by 8-12pp.\\\" Kendall τ=0.91证明model ranking 在calibration后基本保持正确——contamination改变的是绝对分数而非相对排名， 但ContamCal在absolute calibration上的优势对于跨benchmark比较至关重要。\\n\\n\\nbest档核心实验。4PL+γ MAE=1.97pp完全复现仿真表现——真实SFT数据上的contamination 结构与仿真假设匹配良好。MMLU MAE最低(1.8pp)因为item数量最多(14K)提供了最强的 统计功效；HumanEval最高(2.4pp)因为item少且code execution评分的binary nature 增加了noise。93% coverage接近nominal 95%，略低是因为real data的item heterogeneity 比仿真更大，但仍在可接受范围。CI宽度5.8pp在sharpness和coverage间取得了好的平衡。\\nBaselines方面：vanilla 4PL(无γ)MAE=6.1pp最差，因为完全忽略contamination， 证明contamination covariate是必要的。Emperor's mitigation MAE=5.7pp次差， 与ICML 2025发现一致——mitigation strategies确实不够有效。Linear regression MAE=3.5pp 是最好的baseline，但仍比ContamCal差44%——IRT的优势在于non-linear item response 建模和proper uncertainty propagation。Remove-rescore MAE=4.2pp受限于binary flagging丢失了contamination程度信息。Single-signal 2PL+γ MAE=3.8pp表明 signal fusion和4PL复杂度各贡献了一部分改善。\\nθ-γ posterior correlation=0.31 < 0.4阈值，证实identifiability。 gamma rel_bias=0.06与仿真的0.068几乎一致。NUTS诊断完美——无divergence， Rhat<1.01，ESS>800。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"scale_bridging_7b\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B在5个dosage水平下的controlled SFT注入，验证calibration在更大模型上的有效性。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp\": 4.8,\n      \"dosage_50pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp\": 7.6,\n      \"dosage_100pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp\": 10.2,\n      \"contam_cal_mae_pp_mean_7b\": 2.2,\n      \"contam_cal_ci_coverage_95_7b\": 0.92,\n      \"contam_cal_kendall_tau_7b\": 0.89,\n      \"mae_increase_vs_3b_pp\": 0.3,\n      \"gamma_mean_7b\": 0.38,\n      \"dose_response_spearman_7b\": 0.94\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 9: 7B Scale Bridging Results\",\n        \"rows\": 5,\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"dosage\",\n          \"inflation_pp\",\n          \"contam_cal_mae_pp\",\n          \"ci_coverage_95\",\n          \"kendall_tau\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"7B结果证明ContamCal从小模型到中等规模模型的可扩展性。MAE增加有限(+0.3pp) 且符合理论预期——更大的模型有更复杂的ability landscape但contamination的相对效应更小。\\n\\n\\nbest档下7B模型表现略弱于0.5-3B但仍在acceptable范围内。7B的inflation略低于小模型 (50% dosage: 7.6pp vs 9.3pp mean for smaller)因为7B的更强泛化能力意味着 contamination的relative contribution更小。MAE略增至2.2pp(+0.3pp vs 3B)因为 7B模型的item response pattern更复杂，但仍远优于baselines。gamma估计值0.38略低于 小模型的0.42，反映了contamination对larger model的较小相对效应。 Coverage 92%和Kendall τ=0.89仍然强劲，证明ContamCal可扩展到7B规模。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"signal_survival_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"检测信号在不同训练regime下的可靠性系统评估。 Signal × regime AUC heatmap: 4 signals × {base, SFT-clean, SFT-contaminated, RL-post-trained}。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"embedding_auc_base\": 0.9,\n      \"embedding_auc_sft_clean\": 0.51,\n      \"embedding_auc_sft_contam\": 0.88,\n      \"embedding_auc_rl\": 0.55,\n      \"mink_auc_base\": 0.86,\n      \"mink_auc_sft_clean\": 0.53,\n      \"mink_auc_sft_contam\": 0.84,\n      \"mink_auc_rl\": 0.58,\n      \"constat_auc_base\": 0.5,\n      \"constat_auc_sft_clean\": 0.5,\n      \"constat_auc_sft_contam\": 0.82,\n      \"constat_auc_rl\": 0.67,\n      \"selfcritique_auc_base\": 0.5,\n      \"selfcritique_auc_sft_clean\": 0.5,\n      \"selfcritique_auc_sft_contam\": 0.79,\n      \"selfcritique_auc_rl\": 0.72,\n      \"signal_survival_rl_best\": \"Self-Critique\",\n      \"signal_survival_rl_second\": \"ConStat\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 10 (Supporting Contribution): Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap\",\n        \"rows\": 4,\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"signal\",\n          \"base\",\n          \"sft_clean\",\n          \"sft_contam\",\n          \"rl_post_trained\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"这是论文的Supporting Contribution 5。关键insight：RL post-training创造了一个 \\\"signal desert\\\"——只有Self-Critique和ConStat存活。这解释了为什么RL regime 需要更宽的CI（更少信号→更大不确定性），同时也为2-signal degraded mode提供了 empirical justification。\\n\\n\\nbest档下信号存活模式清晰：embedding和Min-K%++在SFT-contaminated上表现强劲 (0.88/0.84)但在RL后严重降级(0.55/0.58)——RL的policy gradient更新破坏了 token-level memorization pattern，使得perplexity-based信号失效。 ConStat在RL后保留AUC=0.67因为它测量的是performance gap(original vs paraphrase) 这一higher-level信号，不依赖model internals。Self-Critique在RL后最强(0.72) 因为它利用模型的reasoning能力来自我评估，RL强化了这种元认知能力而非削弱。 base模型和SFT-clean模型上ConStat和Self-Critique接近chance(0.50)是正确的—— 没有contamination时不应有信号（specificity验证）。 这个heatmap直接支持RRF fusion的必要性：没有任何单一信号在所有regime下都最优。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"rl_observational_case_study\",\n    \"description\": \"对现有RL-trained模型(Qwen2.5-Instruct系列, DeepSeek-R1-Distill系列) 应用Self-Critique + available signals，拟合IRT with wider CIs， expected regret量化。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"selfcritique_auc_rl_models_mean\": 0.71,\n      \"available_signals_rl_count\": 2,\n      \"contam_cal_ci_width_95_rl_pp\": 11.4,\n      \"contam_cal_ci_width_95_sft_comparison_pp\": 5.8,\n      \"ci_width_ratio_rl_vs_sft\": 1.97,\n      \"expected_regret_uncalibrated\": 0.38,\n      \"expected_regret_calibrated_wide_ci\": 0.22,\n      \"expected_regret_remove_rescore\": 0.31,\n      \"regret_reduction_vs_uncalibrated\": 0.42,\n      \"regret_reduction_vs_remove_rescore\": 0.29,\n      \"near_zero_gamma_clean_benchmark_check\": 0.03,\n      \"gamma_posterior_rl_mean\": 0.28,\n      \"gamma_posterior_rl_sd\": 0.14,\n      \"gamma_ci_includes_zero_rl\": false,\n      \"num_models_rl_case\": 8,\n      \"kendall_tau_rl_top5_selection\": 0.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 11: RL Case Study — Expected Regret Comparison\",\n        \"rows\": 3,\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"expected_regret\",\n          \"regret_reduction_vs_naive\",\n          \"top5_kendall_tau\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 12: RL vs SFT CI Width Comparison\",\n        \"rows\": 2,\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"regime\",\n          \"mean_ci_width_95_pp\",\n          \"gamma_mean\",\n          \"gamma_sd\",\n          \"signal_count\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"RL case study的叙事完美支持Claim 3。核心message不是\\\"ContamCal在RL上也很准\\\" （那不诚实），而是\\\"ContamCal在RL上给出了appropriately uncertain的答案， 这些uncertain answers仍然改善了决策\\\"。42% regret reduction是一个compelling number。 Near-zero gamma specificity check排除了\\\"方法总是报告contamination\\\"的担忧。\\n\\n\\nbest档下RL observational case study展示了\\\"wide CIs are the correct answer\\\"的完整叙事。 Self-Critique AUC=0.71（略超0.70阈值）在RL模型上提供了可用但noisy的信号。 CI宽度11.4pp约为SFT的2倍——这不是方法失败，而是正确反映了RL regime下检测信号的 更大不确定性。gamma posterior mean=0.28 (sd=0.14)表明RL模型确实存在contamination 效应但估计更不确定；CI不包含0证明信号是directionally informative的。\\nExpected regret量化是关键：uncalibrated选择top-5模型的expected regret=0.38， 使用wide-CI calibrated scores后降至0.22（42% reduction），优于remove-rescore的0.31。 机制：即使CI很宽，calibrated scores的point estimate仍然比naive scores更准确， 而wide CI让决策者知道应该对RL模型的排名更谨慎。\\nNear-zero gamma check在known-clean benchmark上γ=0.03(接近0)， 通过specificity检验——模型不会对uncontaminated data产生false alarm。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"prior_sensitivity\",\n    \"description\": \"使用γ prior N(0,0.5)和N(0,2)（默认N(0,1)）重新拟合IRT， 验证calibrated scores和CIs对prior选择的鲁棒性。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"mae_prior_tight_n05\": 2.1,\n      \"mae_prior_default_n10\": 1.97,\n      \"mae_prior_wide_n20\": 2.0,\n      \"coverage_95_prior_tight\": 0.91,\n      \"coverage_95_prior_default\": 0.93,\n      \"coverage_95_prior_wide\": 0.95,\n      \"ci_width_prior_tight_pp\": 4.9,\n      \"ci_width_prior_default_pp\": 5.8,\n      \"ci_width_prior_wide_pp\": 7.1,\n      \"gamma_mean_prior_tight\": 0.39,\n      \"gamma_mean_prior_default\": 0.42,\n      \"gamma_mean_prior_wide\": 0.44,\n      \"max_mae_diff_across_priors_pp\": 0.13,\n      \"kendall_tau_prior_tight\": 0.9,\n      \"kendall_tau_prior_default\": 0.91,\n      \"kendall_tau_prior_wide\": 0.91\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 13: Prior Sensitivity Analysis\",\n        \"rows\": 3,\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"prior\",\n          \"mae_pp\",\n          \"coverage_95\",\n          \"ci_width_pp\",\n          \"gamma_mean\",\n          \"kendall_tau\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Prior sensitivity结果证明方法稳健。MAE变化<0.15pp且ranking完全稳定， 满足了Bayesian方法的基本robustness要求。default prior N(0,1)在 coverage/sharpness trade-off上最优。\\n\\n\\nbest档下prior sensitivity表现理想：三种prior下MAE差异仅0.13pp，Kendall τ几乎 不变(0.90-0.91)。tight prior N(0,0.5)略微shrink了gamma估计(0.39 vs 0.42) 导致MAE略高(2.1pp)，但差异很小。wide prior N(0,2)允许gamma更大(0.44)且CI更宽 (7.1pp vs 5.8pp)，coverage从93%升至95%但sharpness代价可接受。 这种行为说明：(1)数据信息量足够大，prior的影响被likelihood dominated； (2)在best档的高信号质量下，任何reasonable prior都能得到好的结果。 这直接回应了\\\"prior choice drives results\\\"的潜在reviewer concern。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"few_examinee_regime\",\n    \"description\": \"仿真研究：model count 20/50/100/200下的IRT性能。 两阶段估计策略：用Growing Pains 400+模型池预估item参数作为informative priors。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"mae_pp_n20_no_preestimate\": 4.8,\n      \"mae_pp_n20_with_preestimate\": 2.9,\n      \"mae_pp_n50_no_preestimate\": 2.8,\n      \"mae_pp_n50_with_preestimate\": 2.1,\n      \"mae_pp_n100_no_preestimate\": 2.0,\n      \"mae_pp_n100_with_preestimate\": 1.9,\n      \"mae_pp_n200_no_preestimate\": 1.7,\n      \"mae_pp_n200_with_preestimate\": 1.7,\n      \"preestimate_benefit_n20_pp\": 1.9,\n      \"preestimate_benefit_n50_pp\": 0.7,\n      \"preestimate_benefit_n100_pp\": 0.1,\n      \"coverage_95_n20_preestimate\": 0.9,\n      \"coverage_95_n50_preestimate\": 0.92,\n      \"coverage_95_n100_preestimate\": 0.93,\n      \"gamma_rel_bias_n20_preestimate\": 0.12,\n      \"gamma_rel_bias_n50_preestimate\": 0.08,\n      \"min_viable_model_count\": 50\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 14: Few-Examinee Regime Study\",\n        \"rows\": 8,\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"n_models\",\n          \"preestimate\",\n          \"mae_pp\",\n          \"coverage_95\",\n          \"ci_width_pp\",\n          \"gamma_rel_bias\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"N=50 with pre-estimation是论文推荐的minimum viable configuration。 pre-estimation策略巧妙利用了existing model evaluation pools（如Growing Pains的 Open LLM Leaderboard数据），无需额外实验成本。\\n\\n\\nbest档下few-examinee仿真展示了清晰的performance gradient和pre-estimation策略的价值。 N=20裸跑MAE=4.8pp不可接受，但pre-estimation将其降至2.9pp——从Growing Pains的 400+模型池中借用item parameter estimates作为informative prior极大地稳定了估计。 N=50是一个sweet spot：裸跑MAE已降至2.8pp，pre-estimation进一步降至2.1pp。 N=100+时pre-estimation的marginal benefit趋近于0（0.1pp），因为数据本身已足够。 min viable model count设为50（with pre-estimation），此时coverage 92%且 gamma rel_bias 8%都在可接受范围。这直接回应了reviewer concern #6 \\\"too few models\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"observational_72b\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B观测分析（仅推理，无SFT）。将ecological validity扩展到frontier模型规模。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"gamma_posterior_72b_mmlu\": 0.18,\n      \"gamma_posterior_72b_gsm8k\": 0.12,\n      \"gamma_ci_excludes_zero_72b_mmlu\": true,\n      \"gamma_ci_excludes_zero_72b_gsm8k\": false,\n      \"calibrated_score_shift_mmlu_pp\": -3.2,\n      \"calibrated_score_shift_gsm8k_pp\": -1.8,\n      \"ci_width_95_72b_pp\": 8.5,\n      \"selfcritique_auc_72b_estimated\": 0.68,\n      \"qualitative_consistency_with_7b\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 15: 72B Observational Analysis\",\n        \"rows\": 4,\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"gamma_mean\",\n          \"gamma_ci_lower\",\n          \"gamma_ci_upper\",\n          \"calibrated_shift_pp\",\n          \"ci_width_pp\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"72B结果支持\\\"contamination effects exist at all scales but diminish with scale\\\"的叙事。 这是生态效度论证——不是定量验证，而是证明ContamCal在frontier scale下产生 plausible和internally consistent的结果。\\n\\n\\nbest档下72B观测分析提供了重要的ecological validity但不能有ground truth验证。 gamma=0.18（MMLU）表明即使72B模型也存在可检测的contamination效应，但效应量小于 小模型(0.42)——这合理因为72B的能力足够强使得contamination的relative contribution更小。 MMLU上gamma CI排除0说明信号存在；GSM8K上CI包含0说明reasoning benchmark对72B的 contamination效应可能在noise floor以下。calibrated score下调3.2pp（MMLU） 是一个substantive但不极端的correction。CI宽度8.5pp反映了observational setting 的更大不确定性。Self-Critique AUC=0.68略低于0.70阈值，但仍在\\\"方向性有效\\\"范围内。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"closed_weight_2signal_mode\",\n    \"description\": \"降级2-signal模式(ConStat + Self-Critique)的消融研究， 量化2-signal vs 4-signal的calibration accuracy差距。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"contam_cal_2signal_mae_pp\": 2.4,\n      \"contam_cal_4signal_mae_pp\": 1.97,\n      \"mae_increase_2signal_relative\": 0.1,\n      \"contam_cal_2signal_ci_coverage_95\": 0.94,\n      \"contam_cal_2signal_ci_width_95_pp\": 7.2,\n      \"contam_cal_2signal_kendall_tau\": 0.87,\n      \"contam_cal_2signal_dose_response_spearman\": 0.92,\n      \"still_beats_best_baseline\": true,\n      \"margin_over_best_baseline_2signal_relative\": 0.31\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 16: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Degraded Mode Comparison\",\n        \"rows\": 2,\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"mode\",\n          \"mae_pp\",\n          \"coverage_95\",\n          \"ci_width_pp\",\n          \"kendall_tau\",\n          \"margin_vs_baseline\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"2-signal模式的10% MAE degradation是一个acceptable trade-off，证明ContamCal 可以gracefully degrade到closed-weight settings。论文可以confidence地claim \\\"even without model internals access, ContamCal provides meaningful calibration improvement over baselines.\\\" 这大幅扩展了方法的practical applicability。\\n\\nbest档下2-signal降级模式MAE增加10%(2.4pp vs 1.97pp)，在best档范围[0.05, 0.15]的 中间位置。CI宽度从5.8pp增至7.2pp（+24%），coverage从93%升至94%——更宽的CI 正确补偿了更少信号带来的更大不确定性。Kendall τ从0.91降至0.87，ranking能力略降 但仍然strong。关键：2-signal模式仍然beat best baseline 31%（2.4pp vs 3.5pp）， 证明即使在closed-weight限制下ContamCal仍有实际价值。 MAE增加主要来自ConStat在某些benchmark上的noise较大（缺少embedding和Min-K%++ 的complementary information），但Self-Critique的reasoning-level信号提供了 必要的anchor。dose-response spearman=0.92仍然strong。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":482,"startLine":1,"totalLines":482}}}
